#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5e283886dc7b770de24e9ff4b0b1a475e07cfe39477df06526566c9ef378387
#. default-sha256: ac434b0abd7106d2bb09359b89365b6156eead0b0b48a26856ab9c9a1823806a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era passata circa una settimana da allora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb8d709c4f223198885250f929687b2ce76b5fbf29a9002d324c4421eaed56cc
#. default-sha256: b8d634ac9f1a2b526f8e45b31c7b726b8691c0a4774496b5a353d6d082a65275
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi, come al solito, stava trascorrendo⟪k:1⟫il proprio tempo a "
"leggere nella sua stanza, rimanendo dentro casa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quando all’improvviso, Maria fece "
"irruzione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c9eedd7cdb4b428075ec647f169a769775bf05e2f4cdfd52d662e790756a253
#. default-sha256: 9a68e7511b791ecd8275c1ce38f29f1a41ca093906472aef1e3f70e4eb40eaa3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d3d3252ca484ddd28d77540fa58bd59fafd6b49a3cd2687eaf0e8828125ef1d
#. default-sha256: 3643192b08d9c0eae7b20f06050cd785ffb50f1b1706c8766505784528b78a6a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh mio Dio. Sei senza fiato. Cos’è successo?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb787271fbc3240227605297f46503b13d210956f7d9117fd77b582d1c3e16c4
#. default-sha256: 402d8c4b7160a74d5dcffb40e3bb0d4bdf5354a80634def6b0d2afc5fd4662cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“⟪k:2⟫È⟪k:3⟫ successo” che abbiamo un ⟪k:4⟫grosso problema⟪k:5⟫!⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I-⟪k:8⟫Il "
"giardino... ⟪k:9⟫Il giardino di rose!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29675a78c074989587b517703e6e4b5dc4baff242b78fa3a58a9105599fccf2e
#. default-sha256: df9e8f7496fbe4115c13e41ffbbcc08d679e62031e0fd0249910248a027dfe94
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il giardino...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e87091ef2a767f1ccdd2bdad0cc86dbc3a493675a60527e6c704bb826bd42cf
#. default-sha256: 0f6f751b2c9f56f9f52c8d1104f1a5ec6ed55433553e01c80ff52a8f519fbea2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le rose di cui ti prendevi così tanta cura sono state abbattute!⟪k:2⟫Le perderemo tutte "
"se non ci sbrighiamo!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e99bb3e8e46cc72b262ee44c486f73b9b907837693ae33e1d07072e7ede91444
#. default-sha256: 5fe5d36542b112d1b7275b43037f4dace539f9f70d4cce66cfb8c380597ddd7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6cc15e942957817ffe510b351c85559697f501f76b14cb0aa3b586b922f6c0f
#. default-sha256: b1ca54c11d899af894bd70b5d1beaa8abd168a4f597432b8ad8f3436095c0f89
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dopo aver sentito la notizia, la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi si precipitò "
"fuori dalla stanza diretta verso il giardino, con Maria che la seguiva."

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 949bce6f5a9c93d26603012d514e6612a61aa81b3a4a028c095f06d1a3ac2594
#. default-sha256: 8d832df9fc1118377c2a70dea1fdc2c920aff854c66ff01a4d3d39679c01415a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quando arrivò, vide una dozzina di uomini robusti e sudati al lavoro,⟪k:3⟫e Jacopo "
"che impartiva ordini urlando."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51555afb41d87650cf0ea698fdcdb4893201ab43588d807db2b98718bbdc55b7
#. default-sha256: add2565834fe8501335cbc3b4d8245d0be4570643281a79b245977f49e29e3b1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era evidente che quegli uomini non avessero né idea del valore di ognuno di quei fiori, né "
"il benché minimo interesse per la loro bellezza..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83b89fc907309c1499c11558ba931e6f20145f75880a4885a7ca736af4cd31d4
#. default-sha256: 6554e1b9e483bf02f51537e2ffc28ba9b1200db4a84db94507ae6e870aee3da1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫poiché stavano tagliando via i cespugli senza pietà e senza scrupoli, come se non fossero "
"altro che erbacce."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc98f55ef76cfa5ef2256672d6fccd3315630d2c98378f8cf9bacc45499cb648
#. default-sha256: 4f781138679ace3161d59d86b9c6ca86fa4f8f784910f0ab2e7c9858287f3fd0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per ogni fiore strappato da terra, un’altra delle tante vite della Ragazza dai Capelli "
"Bianchi si estingueva—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫le vite in cui aveva dedicato tempo e sforzi al fine di veder "
"crescere quelle piante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19ad3c1527cf4430adb9733543b5e1b9d5a966c7033175b7e36925cd712bd293
#. default-sha256: 81a3740a4edda4d211803d881b918097598331eb37b2046eebce364e084a57aa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Jacopo, che cosa stai—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf76de8cee262c23738c6f46ffb6b12a863917cc5156b821d3f4129d5c950603
#. default-sha256: 0add62e31c6cb920de2ebcac88f7f1d591d295b4b36c6518de71fa2db0e97ac6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, ciao Maria.⟪k:2⟫Non mi aspettavo che saresti arrivata con lei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de4aea1308a6637599b631c72f08fa31f86613790b5b4cb5fa50d102858c4f28
#. default-sha256: 65a0c73afe39f2c06daebd87af9460305e6ce62be3051256ecff2397d0b80cb2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché... ⟪k:2⟫Perché mai..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f94b19004931d1ba66f93e91d3b658e1f6c3870e981c102b8efad7b5276145d8
#. default-sha256: 07a5cc694fe069c5d3877edaa7e02cbdb98fe92deb842932f6274f237c4f6bd7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perché? Ma è ovvio.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Questa casa non ha bisogno di un giardino."

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfc4ec25c1f32f509c69684cf68b233b7b0dcf80db79a412efc28c25b0aaeb10
#. default-sha256: 34804b9c543b33558ffa5f56a4d08b2cfef04a8444da6030437fa0cdbaf8eed3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non c’è posto per questi dannati fiori.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tanto vale farci qualcosa di più utile "
"con questo terreno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a6914f034d3a92db6696095db954e57edbe8b926b8f410f44007df065b3812c
#. default-sha256: 2ba1552096fffc1b0ff7678213e2b2d00ba94f5c02cf2414e5cbf5cb8b5edbaa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Una ferrovia in miniatura sarebbe l’ideale,⟪k:2⟫e di certo sarebbe più piacevole alla "
"vista.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Potrei addirittura mettere le mani su alcune ruote originali."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08696f2f583ee7d325b6b35fd7d6439db008a70d33dc22d4ddee89a6200eae14
#. default-sha256: 1bea4ec963be37ae8fa0453766af41a6ed69737f59814b198824c16cd04d5d46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le stesse ruote che sfrecceranno sulla rivoluzionaria ferrovia transcontinentale. ⟪k:1⟫Tra "
"dieci o vent’anni, varranno una fortuna."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67906e45d4979bba4822c82bc9e6b6f4f63a204dcd3bb90d42d546f2b90a24ed
#. default-sha256: d8151c77861f8b3b582b9496d74b77b4ba3eaf7cfad89a8cfe34bdb45b680d06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84d2baf61b63f1f97d5c3c3483b27e5b84e9481f2082af79c95177fdb943bc84
#. default-sha256: 75d12b044975d54a0aed5b99ba4caea5050a8209416e2ff2d0eb270ee8a593f1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tu sai... ⟪k:2⟫quanto tengo a questo giardino."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0586405ab3b59b90312e3229e085b4583a5abdf5be801c44b98b36a56bf4448
#. default-sha256: b10d82a68a4d62c3150b0936b91ec0a6453ec8e4e51fd231ecb20cc3c4dfeb9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09dc9cebc2a57a049efb25cba9a9d2996bce0271d8c56c8b9d44b59fa99c4dd4
#. default-sha256: d3ccce997d97b8988b2b135e810f2d5dffef2418a1451cc45be672b40bfea34a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pensi davvero che non ce ne sia bisogno?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I fiori hanno un effetto rilassante "
"sulle persone. Ci danno pace."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c38f2c8b876fed6713faf5c73065f37e349b9b09bf31fccca57da724865093d0
#. default-sha256: 51ef24bdaa48a4dc9d63f8079ba50d9aa60e80427288a783700b03b26efe5e37
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They are not, by any means, worthless—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non sono affatto inutili—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 770d712c0a656c05dd64b7ff51c7985d4f75422ef68012c1fdffa2959de28ee1
#. default-sha256: 40402f014902b13c22bd54b10724fe2f632735a23eecd2e05f173219ffc95858
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So you’re saying that white rose was your passive-aggressive way of telling me to “calm "
"down”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quindi stai dicendo che quella rosa bianca era il tuo modo⟪k:2⟫passivo-aggressivo di "
"dirmi di calmarmi?"

