msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—! Niente affatto! Ho solo pensato che—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9679a9019358fa2782898cc10fc26f604a94121e8505fa25a195ec67bce8ad3d
