msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With that rose arch out of the picture, we’ll have a much better view. ⟪k:2⟫There won’t "
"be anything blocking the sun any longer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Con quell’arco di rose fuori dai piedi,⟪k:2⟫avremo una vista decisamente migliore.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫Non ci sarà più nulla a bloccare i raggi del sole."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a915635977f403ff5825f1f8efc6797a1075479cdddfe036b5aa8e0129433d5a
