msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Weren’t you supposed to be sensitive to sunlight?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Spend too much time out here "
"and you’re liable to fall ill."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non eri sensibile alla luce solare?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Se resti troppo tempo qua fuori rischierai "
"di ammalarti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CDAC70DC_BEF6_456F_97B2_F46E91647DC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
