msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Get back inside, now. You too, Maria."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Torna dentro. ⟪k:2⟫Adesso.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Anche tu, Maria."

