msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quella povera ragazza, sebbene non avesse detto una parola,⟪k:4⟫stava "
"sicuramente pensando,"

#: scenario3:scenario3_199C1E3F_5208_408E_B782_D56BD7305B39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0bb17508292db6c8c2985c66b2f0b203a4d999d406f0f459999ae9ceaffca9a
#. default-sha256: 5de6fec002c58880767976f698a6628de440f7013f9ec552fecdb112fb75ec17
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_199C1E3F_5208_408E_B782_D56BD7305B39"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“Are you truly that determined to rob me of my sanctuary?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“Sei davvero così determinato a privarmi del mio santuario?”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f5582a9765300ab061ad66cfb9de4dca01bed3a7d25d2b46937b94ba32528eb
#. default-sha256: 88e17c4e7160986c17e16671c25461bcfe66a3a5a43b9b9f2e72d21a0f2c757d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CA1406A6_68E7_420E_8297_978A9FA34DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The words twirled around in her head, unable to make the final journey to her lips. She "
"stood there, looking down at her own feet as her husband marched off..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le parole le roteavano in testa, incapaci di raggiungere le sue labbra. ⟪k:1⟫Mentre suo "
"marito marciava via, lei rimase lì, a guardarsi i piedi..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EBA9086F_5D46_44D1_AFC2_6781C81A9E6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d2ef0655eb01ad1448480082e56730aeb4dbcf1f676de4555d9af95c544dbad
#. default-sha256: 812c8c66c8d7b5f33445f0112f02563a0f3ab6cb8e94e644da6c7ca9c455b4cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EBA9086F_5D46_44D1_AFC2_6781C81A9E6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and listened to the screams of the roses being reaped."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e ad ascoltare le urla delle rose che venivano tagliate."

#: scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b07364c4a7cdc95cb7bb796a20d23e6ae7504da475096ab13877bb1480a9f02b
#. default-sha256: 85f8b003a2c79b9f44d6e0ef94981bba9c7cfe69677456e442cb5894da77e02d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_927E28C5_6C98_4A06_A65C_B8944EE19E6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫After being torn down by Jacopo, the garden reverted to a state of ruined desolation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Una volta abbattuto, il giardino tornò in uno stato di rovina e desolazione."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7103c59b41eb652157242c4fe3bf61fdb9f0dd52402bbace08eeff059fa60876
#. default-sha256: fd95047a28e61f2afd51faa3f180665ddd9438f74cee3d08c002e2b3230cdc21
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79874CDC_E128_434D_93B8_7FAC2FA40F2B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A shame, after all the work that went into restoring it to the beauty it had under the "
"flaxen-haired family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era una vergogna, dopo tutto il lavoro richiesto per farlo tornare alla bellezza del tempo "
"della Villa delle Rose."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8eec4a94647de333aee8166142e10dc9d6aec9d30f138664ed76de4c812957d
#. default-sha256: bc50a62e4aebc2d53e749147b96f5ffb671b102258291b03ea71938be3a76554
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFDAB351_6FD0_4860_BF80_181134F8729D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as Jacopo had said, in its place went scraps of metal, train wheels, prototype models, "
"carbon rods."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E come aveva detto Jacopo, al suo posto vennero disposti rottami di metallo, ruote dei "
"treni, modelli di prototipi e barre di carbonio."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0c18fd3d05e8d93c3bcf695e2283bcb134fcea08c4d74078c43e3704bb95695
#. default-sha256: 0cd271f9807bf0549c00b28d93da8ffb0693196217ae656e4197c02de05dd1b1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2352417E_64FD_4241_BDC4_5261059AA706"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫These items may have had value for him, but I certainly do not think it was worth robbing "
"his wife of a place that made her feel comfortable just so he could store them there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quegli articoli potevano anche avere un valore per lui, ma non penso affatto che valesse la "
"pena privare sua moglie del luogo che la faceva sentire a suo agio solo per poter immagazzinare "
"lì la propria roba."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97eeb4fd6d3458d5fd50c9fb4ee912bf7e465a2d64d356039e211bc6bca85a96
#. default-sha256: 69e6c764bfc5953b3715b07a7cdc6d523723653dcc809cde7b1dff47cf378db7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B6CF7A65_EC65_4D7C_AF85_6AA49A616898"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Besides, I was rather fond of the rose garden myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The roses seemed to evoke a "
"sense of nostalgia in me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inoltre, io stessa ero molto affezionata a quel giardino.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le rose sembravano "
"evocare un senso di nostalgia in me."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b58d8e538aae107b1e99e7d82bf28db3f338833ac5d0653f893af439b6c514f
#. default-sha256: 6243b7aa0ae7efe95d7e2df35418a85732f4beac5ee34f72ecd0694596c6817a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37511A7E_68F1_413D_A27E_340C4758AA23"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt as though, somewhere far beyond the edge of my memories,⟪k:1⟫I had seen another "
"garden of roses,⟪k:2⟫modest though it may have been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sentivo come se da qualche parte, ben oltre il limite dei miei ricordi,⟪k:1⟫avessi visto un "
"altro giardino di rose, per quanto modesto potesse essere."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18d6617318974fbe21acd51b016125d60a92d8b9af2e2f873c057d1bfc6002d2
#. default-sha256: ed67b4c3e83bb80d136e16028adcdfa7da74760e344d2286643e351572724154
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E4E06865_5116_4472_9D00_B9C1BFAD32E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I cannot remember when it was..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non riesco a ricordare quando è stato..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c47413ae7a564a7cc25d6411284ad7555db5f51981947371d16315feaf69d016
#. default-sha256: 501a876ba26486b52c415e07cda40751ae4503d5093f23ffeb2f614a50f31f27
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A7238012_6A5F_4D65_9EBB_8922D34F7E49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Does that come as a surprise to you? ⟪k:1⟫I am quite sure there are periods of the mansion’s "
"history of which I am not aware."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questo la sorprende? ⟪k:1⟫Sono abbastanza sicura che ci siano periodi⟪k:2⟫nella storia della "
"villa di cui io stessa non sono a conoscenza."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 128c92d401e4f292f91c46bf6f666f52733aacc309250aa9cae233652639c985
#. default-sha256: d3a2c1f87b73b69ef367595e761c786a61bf0301ef5df15c36e1f9f4b24afaf0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F313D77A_1405_4E02_9BE3_D5837AFD3794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But in any case, Jacopo had caused many people great pain in order to repurpose that garden "
"for himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma in ogni caso, Jacopo aveva causato un grande dolore a molte persone, utilizzando quel "
"giardino per se stesso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06ced73d17372ad313b378ce6f090d822f06b1274259d3f544eb5294b0f23e96
#. default-sha256: 83b1247014c1c0cf782f1d5cc2ec8efa6f1a61a6d695c137fd8f2d1d98d2dba2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEA60DD2_A735_4799_AA1D_26C227345BD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he continued to walk all over his wife. ⟪k:1⟫Whenever she tried to do something kind for "
"him, he would brush her off, saying, “That’s not your place.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E continuava a calpestare sua moglie. ⟪k:1⟫Ogni volta che lei cercava di fare qualcosa di "
"gentile per lui, la scansava via dicendo, “Non è il tuo posto”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d26a00123482fccf0ec29b8a05957e2da5ae2d28c705706fee60000ce983bcae
#. default-sha256: bfc02494787c1f9cafea132764cd663ea3bdb413ba694d866d3c51f2735c066e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C55223D9_5795_4B6C_98B6_7358EFEEEE4F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He paid no mind whatsoever to the looks of dejection that rose to her face each time he "
"rejected her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non badava minimamente al suo sguardo abbattuto ogni volta che la respingeva."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F89FDF2E_9C37_4FC5_B341_FD9968647660
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
