"⟪k:5⟫It was obvious how much you loved them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Lo capisco. ⟪k:2⟫Davvero.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hai messo anima e corpo nel prenderti cura del "
"giardino.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫È⟪k:8⟫ chiaro quanto tu lo amassi."

